WEBVTT

00:09:27.497 --> 00:09:32.563
so strong that it can surpass differences.

00:09:33.463 --> 00:09:37.130
Why are we so scared
of differences anyway?

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:44.363
I also want us to be a people
that plant seeds,

00:09:44.363 --> 00:09:48.730
seeds of change, seeds of influence,

00:09:48.763 --> 00:09:50.430
seeds of diversity.

00:09:51.663 --> 00:09:56.697
Again, I cannot promise
to you or anyone else

00:09:56.697 --> 00:10:00.297
that planting that seed
is going to make a difference.